# REGRESSION (`todo/t0841`, R48 Track D1) — a VECTOR source, not a range.
#
# The iterable is walked AFTER the two-pass call (it is evaluated once, before
# the loop starts), while the body is walked inside it. This cell pins that the
# split is by EXECUTION FREQUENCY and not by syntax: swapping a range for a
# collection changes the source arm of the loop dispatcher and must not change
# the ownership decision made for the body.
#
# AXIS CELL: comprehension kind = LIST · body sub-position = ELEMENT ·
# source = Vector[int] · element type = String (heap-forced).
#
# RED-VERIFIED at pre-fix HEAD, both lanes: run rc 134, `free(): double free
# detected in tcache 2` (C and `--backend=llvm`); `--sanitize` reports
# `AddressSanitizer: attempting double-free`.

String mk(String a, String b):
    return a + b

void main():
    Vector[int] nums = [1, 2, 3]
    String s = mk("a", "b")
    Vector[String] parts = [s for n in nums]
    print("".join(parts))
